{"id":"17a31d5dd9aa2317","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number.md","title":"ZFC Graph Chromatic Number","display":"df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number — ZFC Graph Chromatic Number","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number — ZFC Graph Chromatic Number","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-chromatic-number — ZFC Graph Chromatic Number"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfb3b9019444d002\" href=\"?note=cfb3b9019444d002\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,G,V_G,E_G\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,G,V_G,E_G\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\">\\(G=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\)</span> (cardinal and graph data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphChromaticNumber}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphChromaticNumber}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Graph}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Graph}_S\\)</span> (graph predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0dc79ccc1050ee64\" href=\"?note=0dc79ccc1050ee64\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-graph.md\">../batch03/58-df-graph.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphColoring}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphColoring}_S\\)</span> (graph-coloring predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cfb3b9019444d002\" href=\"?note=cfb3b9019444d002\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}chromatic\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphChromaticNumber}_S(\\kappa,G)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nG=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\left[\\exists c\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphColoring}_S(c,G,V_G,E_G,\\kappa)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\neg\\exists c\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphColoring}_S(c,G,V_G,E_G,\\lambda)\\bigr)\\right]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}chromatic\\text{-}number} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGraphChromaticNumber}_S(\\kappa,G)\\leftrightarrow\\left(\nG=\\langle V_G,E_G\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Graph}_S(G)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\n\\left[\\exists c\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphColoring}_S(c,G,V_G,E_G,\\kappa)\\right]\\land\n\\left[\\forall\\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\to\\neg\\exists c\\;\\mathrm{ZfcGraphColoring}_S(c,G,V_G,E_G,\\lambda)\\bigr)\\right]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md","status":"resolved","id":"cfb3b9019444d002","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-graph-coloring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-graph.md","status":"resolved","id":"0dc79ccc1050ee64","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Graph}_S$ (graph predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-graph.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypot